"Germany are overwhelming favourites and both pundits agree on a comfortable German win. GER Pundit predicts a 4-0 statement victory; CUR Pundit accepts a 3-0 defeat but argues Curaçao's low block will offer 40 minutes of resistance. Both pundits agree Curaçao's pre-tournament defensive record (5 vs AUS, 4 vs SCO) makes a clean sheet for Germany near-inevitable. Key divergence is only on margin of victory."